{"release":{"id":272740540,"tag":"v1.5.2","author":"kevin-thankyou-lin","name":"v1.5.2","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2025-12-23T22:58:51Z","publishedAt":"2025-12-24T22:28:42Z","markdown":"## What's Changed\r\n* Update domain randomization wrapper to work with  mujoco!=3.1.1 for some settings by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/585\r\n* Bump version 1.5.0 -> 1.5.1 by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/601\r\n* updates to docs for v1.5 by @Abhiram824 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/604\r\n* Fix doc links by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/608\r\n* potential fix to build and docs synchronization error by @Abhiram824 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/609\r\n* Adding hdiapi to imports for docs for spacemouse by @abhihjoshi in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/610\r\n* Fix-device-docs-I by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/613\r\n* Adding render modalities by @abhihjoshi in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/596\r\n* Adding USD requirements to requirements-extra by @abhihjoshi in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/617\r\n* small update to demos page by @Abhiram824 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/619\r\n* Add all manipulators to demo_random_action by default by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/618\r\n* Replace warn with warning by @squarefk in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/622\r\n* fix the mounting direction of dex hand for panda robot by @xieleo5 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/624\r\n* fix pot with handles when pot is rectangle by @xieleo5 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/628\r\n* Add the joint pos obs back by @squarefk in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/627\r\n* PyPI Publishing GitHub Action by @abhihjoshi in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/629\r\n* [fix] fix mink IK with delta input type by @Dingry in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/626\r\n* Adding pypi workflow by @abhihjoshi in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/632\r\n* Update v1.5.1 changelog by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/634\r\n* Enable instance segmentation to include bodies in arena by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/638\r\n* Update NutAssembly to handle different mounts aside from default by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/642\r\n* modify opencv renderer to support multiple camera view by @xieleo5 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/641\r\n* feat: Dualsense device support by @OceanPresentChao in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/645\r\n* Hot fix `Task.generate_id_mappings()`: remove `left/right_eef_target` from id mappings by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/650\r\n* Allow base_type specification in manipulation envs by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/655\r\n* Adding shell inertia for meshes in Sawyer by @abhihjoshi in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/662\r\n* Support multiple cameras by @squarefk in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/664\r\n* added xarm7 (revised) by @EdwardoSunny in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/667\r\n* [add] add grasp qpos for inspire and fourier hand by @Dingry in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/670\r\n* Update mobile_robot.py by @ShahRutav in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/680\r\n* Update of robot controller and robot-mounted base by @Dingry in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/679\r\n* data collection wrapper resets by @snasiriany in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/688\r\n* [add] add sensors by @Dingry in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/691\r\n* Ensure EGL ImportError includes PYOPENGL_PLATFORM value by @emmanuel-ferdman in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/684\r\n* FIx https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/issues/665 and refactor variable names by @Abhiram824 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/674\r\n* Update composite_controller.py by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/700\r\n* fix baxter mesh issues by @Abhiram824 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/703\r\n* update part controller config to include joint indices by @Abhiram824 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/697\r\n* Updating base type comments by @NirshalChandraSekar in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/732\r\n* Add `set_scale` to `Arena` and `MujocoObject`  by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/643\r\n* fix site scaling to get all sites from world body by @Abhiram824 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/738\r\n* Env seeding by @Abhiram824 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/724\r\n* Pin mink version by @Abhiram824 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/746\r\n* Fixes mobile base xmls and controller logic by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/736\r\n* Enable scaling for mujoco object by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/748\r\n* Fix binding_utils to work on windows by @alek5k in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/751\r\n* Fix visibility of parameters in docs for dark mode by @Abhiram824 in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/759\r\n* Update robot model to correctly add parts by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/761\r\n* Add input_ref_frame = base option for whole body ik and devices by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/754\r\n* auto-detect spacemouse if id (product/vendor) is incorrect by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/764\r\n* Fix duplicated inertial property  + free joint issue by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/765\r\n* Add manipulator mount for add base by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/770\r\n* Allow skip_wbc_action in wbik controller by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/771\r\n* Update version from 1.5.1 to 1.5.2 by @kevin-thankyou-lin in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/783\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @OceanPresentChao made their first contribution in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/645\r\n* @EdwardoSunny made their first contribution in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/667\r\n* @ShahRutav made their first contribution in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/680\r\n* @emmanuel-ferdman made their first contribution in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/684\r\n* @NirshalChandraSekar made their first contribution in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/732\r\n* @alek5k made their first contribution in https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/751\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/compare/v1.5.1...v1.5.2","html":"<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">What's Changed</h2><a id=\"user-content-whats-changed\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What's Changed\" href=\"#whats-changed\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Update domain randomization wrapper to work with  mujoco!=3.1.1 for some settings by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/585\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/585</a>\n</li>\n<li>Bump version 1.5.0 -&gt; 1.5.1 by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/601\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/601</a>\n</li>\n<li>updates to docs for v1.5 by @Abhiram824 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/604\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/604</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix doc links by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/608\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/608</a>\n</li>\n<li>potential fix to build and docs synchronization error by @Abhiram824 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/609\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/609</a>\n</li>\n<li>Adding hdiapi to imports for docs for spacemouse by @abhihjoshi in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/610\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/610</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix-device-docs-I by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/613\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/613</a>\n</li>\n<li>Adding render modalities by @abhihjoshi in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/596\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/596</a>\n</li>\n<li>Adding USD requirements to requirements-extra by @abhihjoshi in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/617\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/617</a>\n</li>\n<li>small update to demos page by @Abhiram824 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/619\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/619</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add all manipulators to demo_random_action by default by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/618\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/618</a>\n</li>\n<li>Replace warn with warning by @squarefk in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/622\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/622</a>\n</li>\n<li>fix the mounting direction of dex hand for panda robot by @xieleo5 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/624\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/624</a>\n</li>\n<li>fix pot with handles when pot is rectangle by @xieleo5 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/628\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/628</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add the joint pos obs back by @squarefk in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/627\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/627</a>\n</li>\n<li>PyPI Publishing GitHub Action by @abhihjoshi in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/629\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/629</a>\n</li>\n<li>[fix] fix mink IK with delta input type by @Dingry in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/626\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/626</a>\n</li>\n<li>Adding pypi workflow by @abhihjoshi in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/632\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/632</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update v1.5.1 changelog by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/634\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/634</a>\n</li>\n<li>Enable instance segmentation to include bodies in arena by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/638\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/638</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update NutAssembly to handle different mounts aside from default by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/642\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/642</a>\n</li>\n<li>modify opencv renderer to support multiple camera view by @xieleo5 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/641\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/641</a>\n</li>\n<li>feat: Dualsense device support by @OceanPresentChao in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/645\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/645</a>\n</li>\n<li>Hot fix <code>Task.generate_id_mappings()</code>: remove <code>left/right_eef_target</code> from id mappings by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/650\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/650</a>\n</li>\n<li>Allow base_type specification in manipulation envs by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/655\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/655</a>\n</li>\n<li>Adding shell inertia for meshes in Sawyer by @abhihjoshi in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/662\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/662</a>\n</li>\n<li>Support multiple cameras by @squarefk in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/664\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/664</a>\n</li>\n<li>added xarm7 (revised) by @EdwardoSunny in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/667\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/667</a>\n</li>\n<li>[add] add grasp qpos for inspire and fourier hand by @Dingry in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/670\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/670</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update mobile_robot.py by @ShahRutav in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/680\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/680</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update of robot controller and robot-mounted base by @Dingry in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/679\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/679</a>\n</li>\n<li>data collection wrapper resets by @snasiriany in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/688\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/688</a>\n</li>\n<li>[add] add sensors by @Dingry in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/691\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/691</a>\n</li>\n<li>Ensure EGL ImportError includes PYOPENGL_PLATFORM value by @emmanuel-ferdman in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/684\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/684</a>\n</li>\n<li>FIx <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/issues/665\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/issues/665</a> and refactor variable names by @Abhiram824 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/674\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/674</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update composite_controller.py by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/700\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/700</a>\n</li>\n<li>fix baxter mesh issues by @Abhiram824 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/703\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/703</a>\n</li>\n<li>update part controller config to include joint indices by @Abhiram824 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/697\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/697</a>\n</li>\n<li>Updating base type comments by @NirshalChandraSekar in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/732\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/732</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add <code>set_scale</code> to <code>Arena</code> and <code>MujocoObject</code>  by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/643\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/643</a>\n</li>\n<li>fix site scaling to get all sites from world body by @Abhiram824 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/738\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/738</a>\n</li>\n<li>Env seeding by @Abhiram824 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/724\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/724</a>\n</li>\n<li>Pin mink version by @Abhiram824 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/746\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/746</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fixes mobile base xmls and controller logic by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/736\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/736</a>\n</li>\n<li>Enable scaling for mujoco object by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/748\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/748</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix binding_utils to work on windows by @alek5k in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/751\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/751</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix visibility of parameters in docs for dark mode by @Abhiram824 in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/759\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/759</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update robot model to correctly add parts by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/761\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/761</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add input_ref_frame = base option for whole body ik and devices by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/754\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/754</a>\n</li>\n<li>auto-detect spacemouse if id (product/vendor) is incorrect by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/764\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/764</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix duplicated inertial property  + free joint issue by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/765\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/765</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add manipulator mount for add base by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/770\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/770</a>\n</li>\n<li>Allow skip_wbc_action in wbik controller by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/771\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/771</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update version from 1.5.1 to 1.5.2 by @kevin-thankyou-lin in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/783\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/783</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">New Contributors</h2><a id=\"user-content-new-contributors\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: New Contributors\" href=\"#new-contributors\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>@OceanPresentChao made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/645\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/645</a>\n</li>\n<li>@EdwardoSunny made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/667\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/667</a>\n</li>\n<li>@ShahRutav made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/680\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/680</a>\n</li>\n<li>@emmanuel-ferdman made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/684\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/684</a>\n</li>\n<li>@NirshalChandraSekar made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/732\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/732</a>\n</li>\n<li>@alek5k made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/751\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/pull/751</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/compare/v1.5.1...v1.5.2\">https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite/compare/v1.5.1...v1.5.2</a></p>\n","assets":[]}}